      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The wooden Cotton Belt Railroad Depot, once called Scott’s Station, now sits in the Scott Plantation Settlement, preserving the town’s plantation‑era heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
